Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.52,1:32:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,想要了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.54,1:32:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-觉得舒服吗 -好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.40,1:33:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,插到底哦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.60,1:34:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.21,1:34:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.57,1:35:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.12,1:35:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.39,1:36:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.99,1:36:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.39,1:36:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了 要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.31,1:37:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样插的话
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.31,1:39:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这样很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.91,1:39:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.32,1:39:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.34,1:40:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在帮你转交语音信箱
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.14,1:40:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,由美 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.48,1:40:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为太担心你了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.88,1:40:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以就回家一趟了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.02,1:40:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,由美你昨晚就没回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.62,1:40:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛要说谎啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.63,1:40:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在在哪 和谁在一起啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.43,1:40:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,由美
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.69,1:42:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,插到底了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.70,1:43:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.46,1:43:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-老师再插进来 -还要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.40,1:43:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还要
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.54,1:43:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.01,1:43:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,老师射进来裡面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.22,1:43:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.07,1:44:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.14,1:44:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.94,1:45:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,又快要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.34,1:45:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一起高潮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.94,1:46:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服 老师
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.88,1:47:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-要高潮了-我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.48,1:48:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(松下纱荣子)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.16,1:48:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.70,1:48:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.30,1:48:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我会乖乖回家的

